Gabe | FabledMemories.com: So, I paused it, and then I paused at Google, I think, like, 2 months ago, just because it was, like, too much. I was spending too much for no return. And then we decided to stop trying to be cheap and, um, and hire somebody else to do it. Um…

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.000
