00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:31.000
Gabe | FabledMemories.com: And then, so yeah, this is where we are now.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:47.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay, got it. Yeah, so you're still in the spot where, kind of, ads are paused, you tried the DIY route, and I hit some roadblocks. Um, and, you know, I hear that a lot, honestly, especially with the Google reps. It's so frustrating, right, because they, like.

