Whitney Hodges: Got it.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:24.000
Gabe | FabledMemories.com: But it's like, keeping up with the trends and everything, I'm like, I'm old, I don't know anything.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.000
Whitney Hodges: Yes.

